  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="transcription" xml:id="transcription_aad_0167" xml:lang="en">
          <div type="letter">
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00507/" ed="1r" type="sheet"/>
            <div type="letter_message" hand="#type_black_else">
              <opener>
                <seg hand="#print_saint_davids_university_college">
                  <lb/><hi rend="underline" hand="#print_saint_davids_university_college"><rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_361">Prifysgol Cymru</rs></hi>
                  <lb/><rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_360">COLEG PRIFYSGOL DEWI SANT</rs>
                  <lb/><rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_561">LLANBEDR PONT STEFFAN</rs>
                  <lb/><rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_563">Ceredigion</rs>
                </seg>
                <seg hand="#print_saint_davids_university_college">
                  <lb/><hi rend="underline" hand="#print_saint_davids_university_college"><rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_361">University of Wales</rs></hi>
                  <lb/><rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_360">SAINT DAVID'S UNIVERSITY COLLEGE</rs>
                  <lb/><rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_561">LAMPETER</rs>
                  <lb/><rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_563">Cardiganshire</rs>
                </seg>
                <seg hand="#print_saint_davids_university_college">
                  <lb/>Tel : Lampeter 351/352/415 - Ext.:
                </seg>
                <dateline>  
                  <date>
                    <lb/><space quantity="45" unit="char"/>20th May I973 
                  </date>
                </dateline>
                <salute>
                  <lb/><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_1">Dear Mr. Auden</rs>,
                </salute>
              </opener>
              <p>
                <lb/><space quantity="6" unit="char"/>I am writing to you as president of the student 'New
                <lb/>Literary Society'. I am at present compiling our programme
                <lb/>f<subst><del rend="overtyped" hand="#type_black_else">p</del><add place="superimposed" hand="#type_black_else">o</add></subst>r I973-4 and would like it to reflect as many aspects of
                <lb/>modern poetry as possible. To this end I hope to arrange
                <lb/>poetry readi<unclear>ng</unclear>s by a varied selection of poets. I would,
                <lb/>therefore, be grateful if you would be willing to give a poetry
                <lb/>rea<subst><del rend="overtyped" hand="#type_black_else"><gap unit="char" quantity="1" reason="illegible"></gap>u</del><add place="superimposed" hand="#type_black_else">di</add></subst>ng to the society.
              </p>
              <p>
               <lb/><space quantity="6" unit="char"/>As you may know <rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_360">Saint David's University College</rs> is the
               <lb/>smallest, but one of the oldest, university colleges in <rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_565">Britain</rs>;
               <lb/>yet it is situated in a part of <rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_564">Wales</rs> that although remote, is 
               <lb/>one of the most beautiful parts. Because the college is a little
               <lb/>more isolated than most we have found that outside speakers
               <lb/>are always assured<unclear>n</unclear>of a warm reception and an appreciative 
               <lb/>audience. Moreover, if you wish to read here the<unclear>c</unclear>college would
               <lb/>be pleased to provide accomodation etc., so that if you wish to
               <lb/>stay in the area for a few days this would be possible. A
               <lb/>suitable date would be late November/early December I973, but
               <lb/>if this proves to be inconvenient I <subst><del rend="overtyped" hand="#type_black_else">e</del><add place="superimposed" hand="#type_black_else">w</add></subst>ould be grateful if you
               <lb/>would sugge<subst><del rend="overtyped" hand="#type_black_else">a</del><add place="superimposed" hand="#type_black_else">s</add></subst>t an alternative. 
              </p>
              <p>
               <lb/><space quantity="6" unit="char"/>I hope that you will be able to accept our offer and
               <lb/>would be obliged if you could suggest a fee together with a
               <lb/>rough estimate of your travelling expenses.
              </p>
              <p>
                <lb/><space quantity="6" unit="char"/>I look forward to hearing from you.
              </p>
              <closer>
              <salute>
                <lb/>Yours sincerely,
              </salute>
              <signed hand="#hand_blue_else">
                <lb/><hi rend="underline" hand="#hand_blue_else"><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_554">Richard Else</rs></hi>
              </signed>
              <signed>
                <lb/><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_554">Richard Else</rs>.
              </signed>
              </closer>
            </div> 
         <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00508/" ed="1v" type="sheet"/>
            <div>
              <ab hand="#hand_blue_unident_0167">
                <lb/>77
              </ab>
            </div>
         </div>
